<section class="hv-dy"><div class="hv-dy-st"><div class="hv-w hv-dy-g"><div class="hv-dy-v"><figure class="hv-dy-i on" data-i="0"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533139502658-0198f920d8e8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="a wristwatch worn by the sea at sunrise" width="900" height="1100" fetchpriority="high"></figure><figure class="hv-dy-i" data-i="1"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522312346375-d1a52e2b99b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="a rose gold watch with a pale pink dial" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy"></figure><figure class="hv-dy-i" data-i="2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1667325511382-9dfe337c9e28?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="a wrist wearing a dark watch in low light" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy"></figure><figure class="hv-dy-i" data-i="3"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629581081513-b5bd49769ff2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="a blue watch on a dark surface" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="hv-dy-r"><p class="hv-ey">A day on the wrist</p><h2>Four hours that matter</h2><div class="hv-dy-ts"><div class="hv-dy-t on" data-i="0"><span>06:00</span><h3>Morning</h3><p>Set the time and wind an automatic before you leave. A quick glance at the date saves an awkward correction later.</p></div><div class="hv-dy-t" data-i="1"><span>12:00</span><h3>Midday</h3><p>A dress watch slides under a cuff; a sports watch shrugs off knocks. Choose the one that suits your day.</p></div><div class="hv-dy-t" data-i="2"><span>18:00</span><h3>Evening</h3><p>Swap the strap, not the watch. Leather for dinner, a fabric strap for the weekend.</p></div><div class="hv-dy-t" data-i="3"><span>23:00</span><h3>Night</h3><p>Rest the watch dial-up, away from phones and speakers whose magnets can upset the timing.</p></div></div><div class="hv-dy-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i id="dy-b"></i></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="hv-s hv-zn" id="zones"><div class="hv-w"><div class="hv-zn-h"><p class="hv-ey">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">World time compare</h2><p class="hv-p">Choose three cities to see their local times side by side, and the hours when it is daytime in all of them. Handy for setting a GMT hand or planning a call.</p></div>
